Joanna encourages reaching for dreams.\n  - sisterhood: Joanna watched a story exploring themes of sisterhood, love, and chasing dreams, which she recommended. She also finished writing her book last week after many late nights and edits.\n  - important issues: Joanna's story, which Nate finds awesome, tackles tough issues including loss and self-discovery, involving a healing road trip.\n  - dialogues exploring loss, redemption, and forgiveness: Joanna mentioned a page with dialogues exploring loss, redemption, and forgiveness for her next movie; she finds the story deep and emotional.\n  - personal experiences and feelings: Joanna shared that meaningful stories arise from vulnerability, exploring personal experiences and feelings, and remaining true to oneself, as acknowledged by Nate.\n  - \"Finding Home\": \"Finding Home\" is a script Joanna is writing with her writers group about a girl's journey to find her true home. She finds the work rewarding and emotional.\n  - new opportunities: Joanna expressed hope that finishing her first screenplay would lead to new opportunities and positive feedback.\n  - meaningful stories: Joanna believes meaningful stories come from personal experiences and feelings, and she writes best when being true to herself, even if difficult.\n  - new one: Nate asked Joanna about the topic of the \"new one\" after mentioning he baked desserts and made ice cream for a friend.\n  - new memories: Joanna stated to Nate to keep making great memories and supporting each other, and to keep reaching for their dreams.\n  - flavors: Joanna is experimenting with and tinkering with recipes to find comfort and be creative, and Nate asked about the specific flavors she is working with.\n  - writing inspiration: Joanna uses taking breaks and self-care for writing inspiration to maintain inspiration and mental health, seeking balance.\n  - happiness: Joanna stated she will always remember moments that bring happiness and reminded Nate that it's important to stay happy and de-stress by doing what makes him happy.\n  - literature: Joanna advises reading lots, trying different genres, and writing/sharing literature to build understanding and improve through practice and feedback.\n  - explore new things: Joanna encouraged Nate to step outside his comfort zone and explore new things, stating the rewards can be great.\n  - activities you love: Joanna shared that writing projects are going well, describing the experience as a mix of highs and lows, and that her journal is her rock, viewing writing as a huge part of her life.\n  - fantasy book series: Joanna recommended finding a fantasy book series to read through for relaxation, noting most fiction series are great reads.\n  - new things: Joanna submitted a screenplay to a film contest and mentioned that people love it when she makes them new things.\n  - fiction series: Joanna recommended finding a fantasy book series to read for relaxation, noting that most fiction series are great reads.\n  - bookmark: Joanna finished a cute little bookmark for a lady at her writing club. Nate commented that the bookmark is great and she will love it.\n  - books: Joanna visited the library in Woodhaven (Midwest) and saw an old book collection; she previously asked Nate for book recommendations, and Nate is looking for new books.\n  - Jo: Joanna (Jo) asked Nate if he celebrated good feedback people are connecting with his writing. Previously, she asked about a couple he met while walking Max.\n  - Writing and creative projects: Joanna is busy with writing projects, which she finds to be a mix of highs and lows. Her journal is a major source of support for her writing endeavors.\n  - research: Joanna has been doing non-stop research and networking for something she is determined to make happen.\n  - new trail: Joanna is hiking on a new trail with friends this weekend to see a waterfall.\n  - picture: Nate complimented Joanna's drawings, asking what inspired them. Joanna previously mentioned seeing her writing acted out and Nate complimented a hiking picture.\n  - Joanna: Joanna is filming her own movie based on her road-trip script. She finds every day on set awesome and is excited to show her vision.\n  - reading: Joanna is relaxing and recharging this weekend with a long walk and some reading.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1967,"context_chars":8239,"retrieval_duration":0.23258399963378906,"response_duration":3.004966974258423,"total_duration":3.237550973892212,"grade":false,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer discusses different themes (sisterhood, love, and chasing dreams) that do not match the specific themes of loss, redemption, and forgiveness mentioned in the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all the necessary information to answer the question about the specific themes explored in Joanna's new book. It explicitly mentions that the book features dialogues exploring loss, redemption, and forgiveness, which are the exact themes listed in the golden answer. Additionally, the context includes other relevant themes such as sisterhood and love, but the key themes from the golden answer are clearly present and detailed.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["loss","redemption","forgiveness","sisterhood","love","chasing dreams"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_9","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_9_qa_5","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What are Dave's dreams?","golden_answer":"open a car maintenance shop, work on classic cars, build a custom car from scratch","hypothesis":"Dave's dreams include:\n\n1. Seeing his favorite performers live (event_time: March 26, 2023).\n2. Opening a car maintenance shop (event_time: May 1, 2023).\n3. Building a custom car from scratch (event_time: May 3, 2023).\n4. Working on classic cars (event_time: May 1, 2023).\n5. Visiting Tokyo someday (event_time: October 19, 2023). \n\nThese dreams reflect his passion for cars, music, and travel.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Dave dreams of seeing his favorite performers live. (event_time: 2023-03-26T16:45:00Z)\n  - Dave's dream was opening the car maintenance shop. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Dave dreams of someday building a custom car from scratch (event_time: 2023-05-03T13:16:00Z)\n  - Dave has a dream of working on classic cars. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Dave dreams about visiting Tokyo someday. (event_time: 2023-10-19T10:11:00Z)\n  - Dave is striving onwards to goals. (event_time: 2023-10-04T14:44:00Z)\n  - Dave intends to continue pursuing his dream. (event_time: 2023-10-08T15:13:00Z)\n  - Dave is achieving his dream related to making a custom car. (event_time: 2023-05-03T13:16:00Z)\n  - Dave's favorite Disney movies teach a lesson about following your dreams no matter what others say (event_time: 2023-09-15T00:13:00Z)\n  - Dave finds fulfillment in helping others unleash creativity (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - Dave followed his dreams and became an engineer. (event_time: 2023-10-25T20:25:00Z)\n  - Dave is focused and working hard with Calvin to make their dreams happen. (event_time: 2023-10-04T14:44:00Z)\n  - Dave achieved his dream. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Calvin encourages Dave regarding chasing his dreams and living his best life. (event_time: 2023-10-08T15:13:00Z)\n  - Dave is encouraged to keep pursuing his passions (event_time: 2023-09-13T10:56:00Z)\n  - Dave's goal is to make Calvin happy (event_time: 2023-09-15T00:13:00Z)\n  - Calvin finds Dave inspiring for pushing himself to achieve his dream. (event_time: 2023-05-03T13:16:00Z)\n  - Dave is interested in auto engineering. (event_time: 2023-04-20T16:15:00Z)\n  - Dave is pursuing the creation of a custom car. (event_time: 2023-08-11T17:22:00Z)\n  - Dave is asking Calvin about his future plans and upcoming exciting developments. (event_time: 2023-09-13T10:56:00Z)\n  - Dave reminds Calvin to never forget his dreams. (event_time: 2023-08-03T13:12:00Z)\n  - Dave is eager to see what Calvin will create next. (event_time: 2023-11-13T21:15:00Z)\n  - Dave encourages Calvin to keep pursuing his dreams. (event_time: 2023-08-03T13:12:00Z)\n  - Calvin believes chasing dreams is essential to life for Dave. (event_time: 2023-10-08T15:13:00Z)\n  - Calvin thinks doing what Dave loves for a living is the ultimate goal (event_time: 2023-10-08T15:13:00Z)\n  - Dave views his activity as a passion. (event_time: 2023-10-08T15:13:00Z)\n  - Dave is involved in a new venture. (event_time: 2023-05-03T13:16:00Z)\n  - Dave believes that the small details are what make something unique and personalized. (event_time: 2023-08-11T17:22:00Z)\n  - Calvin asked Dave what initiated Dave's interest in auto engineering (event_time: 2023-10-25T20:25:00Z)\n  - The progress is motivating for Dave. (event_time: 2023-10-04T14:44:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - dream: Dave is keeping busy chasing his dreams and working hard, encouraged by Calvin's supportive conversations.\n  - goals: Dave is pursuing his childhood goal of restoring and modifying cars, including adding a custom exhaust and performance upgrades. Calvin offered support to keep pushing for these goals.\n  - Dave: Dave is fascinated by how machines work, starting at age ten after fixing an old car. He enjoys car engineering and transforming broken-down vehicles into high-running ones.\n  - Dave: Dave, who is restoring a vintage Mustang engine, has taken up photography, focusing on local scenery. He discussed his photography and the car project with Calvin.\n  - Dave: Dave is an assistant who took up photography, taking pictures of scenery. He found a peaceful spot with a bench under a tree with pink flowers.\n  - Dave: Dave is restoring a Ford Mustang from a junkyard, working on car mods, and added a custom exhaust and performance upgrades to it. He attended a car show last Friday.\n  - Dave: Dave previously enjoyed a card night and is restoring a car for his auto engineering goal. He chatted with Calvin about Calvin's amazing performance on a big stage.\n  - Disney movies: Dave mentioned a Disney poster reminds him of a favorite Disney movie that teaches a lesson about following your dreams regardless of others' opinions.\n  - poster: Calvin showed Dave a cool Disney poster. Dave commented that it reminded him of a favorite Disney movie about following dreams.\n  - Dave: Dave recently returned from San Francisco with insights on car modification, finding satisfaction in fixing and improving old cars to help others.\n  - Dave: Dave enjoys photography, taking pictures of local scenery. He talked with Calvin about Calvin's inspiring chat with an artist at an event.\n  - Disney poster: Calvin showed Dave a cool Disney poster; Dave found it gorgeous and it reminded him of a favorite Disney movie about following dreams.\n  - Dave: Dave recently took up photography, focusing on scenery. He chatted with Calvin about a photo Calvin shared, congratulated him on an amazing-looking event, and acknowledged Calvin's plan to visit Boston.\n  - dad: Dave's dad took him to his first car show when he was 10, which sparked his interest in cars. Dave later became an automotive engineer.\n  - journey: Calvin is on a musical journey, confirmed by Dave who congratulated him on a gala attendance and upcoming performance. Dave is keen to hear about it and see a show in Boston.\n  - Dave: Dave took up photography, taking pictures of the scenery, and shared a photo he took at a serene spot in a nearby park. This updates the previous summary about cleaning/protecting headlights.\n  - Dave: Dave recently returned from a road trip with friends, enjoying the countryside and recharging. This trip reminded him of his passion, which makes long work hours worthwhile.\n  - Dave (assistant): Dave opened his own car maintenance shop, teaming up with a local garage, and is enjoying sharing his car knowledge with awesome mechanics.\n  - rap industry: Dave is looking forward to listening to Calvin's podcast about the rap industry and learning more about it.\n  - Dave: Dave congratulated Calvin on his album release and expressed enthusiasm for live music. Dave invited Calvin to see his cool cars in his garage.\n  - Dave: Dave attended a car workshop in San Francisco to learn car restoration techniques. He also had a card night with friends last Friday and discussed his ongoing car restoration project with Calvin.\n  - achievement: Dave finds fixing up things like a Ford Mustang from a junkyard therapeutic, bringing a sense of accomplishment and joy by transforming the broken into something that runs.\n  - Dave: Dave asked Calvin about his car post-crash, mentioned arranging regular walks with friends in parks, and commented on a mansion's stunning view in Japan.\n  - Dave: Dave's band had a fun rehearsal session last night. Last weekend, Dave attended a rock concert in Boston. Dave is also praised by Calvin for fixing cars.\n  - superhero: Calvin compared Dave fixing cars to being a superhero, making a real difference in someone's life.\n  - Dave: Dave greeted Calvin, mentioned taking up photography (scenery pics), complimented Calvin's gala appearance, and noted his camera captures moments clearly.\n  - garage: Dave's garage is a little dirty but everything is in place; it's where he tinkers with cars, an activity he finds calming. Calvin looks forward to seeing it.\n  - new venture: Dave is teaming up with a local garage for a new car maintenance shop venture, which Calvin congratulated him on.\n  - vibrant city life: Dave described Tokyo's vibrant city life as amazing, alive, and colorful, suggesting it will be an unforgettable experience.\n  - Dave: Dave complimented Calvin's performance picture. He mentioned that Calvin's support for others keeps music going and passes on a legacy.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2039,"context_chars":8321,"retrieval_duration":0.14780163764953613,"response_duration":4.077337741851807,"total_duration":4.225139379501343,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer includes all the key elements of Dave's dreams mentioned in the gold answer, specifically opening a car maintenance shop, working on classic cars, and building a custom car from scratch.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all the necessary information to answer the question about Dave's dreams. It explicitly mentions that Dave dreams of opening a car maintenance shop, working on classic cars, and building a custom car from scratch, which aligns perfectly with the elements listed in the golden answer. Therefore, the context is sufficient to construct a complete answer.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["open a car maintenance shop","work on classic cars","build a custom car from scratch"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_4","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_4_qa_164","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What language does Tim know besides German?","golden_answer":"Spanish","hypothesis":"Tim knows French besides German. He took French in high school.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Tim is currently learning German. (event_time: 2024-01-02T17:26:00Z)\n  - German is one of the languages Tim is learning. (event_time: 2024-01-02T17:26:00Z)\n  - Tim took French in high school. (event_time: 2024-01-02T17:26:00Z)\n  - Tim finds learning another language to be tough but rewarding. (event_time: 2024-01-02T17:26:00Z)\n  - Tim finds the structure of German easier than French. (event_time: 2024-01-02T17:26:00Z)\n  - Tim is looking for resources for learning Spanish (event_time: 2024-01-02T17:26:00Z)\n  - Tim finds learning German tough but worthwhile. (event_time: 2024-01-02T17:26:00Z)\n  - Tim is asking John if John knows any other languages. (event_time: 2024-01-02T17:26:00Z)\n  - Tim intends to continue with his German lessons. (event_time: 2024-01-02T17:26:00Z)\n  - Tim is asking John what made him decide to learn Spanish. (event_time: 2024-01-02T17:26:00Z)\n  - Tim has always been interested in different cultures. (event_time: 2023-12-06T17:34:00Z)\n  - Tim is more into reading. (event_time: 2023-08-26T18:59:00Z)\n  - Tim has always been interested in different countries. (event_time: 2023-12-06T17:34:00Z)\n  - Fantasy stories allow Tim to explore other cultures from home (event_time: 2024-01-02T17:26:00Z)\n  - Tim is more into fantasy novels. (event_time: 2023-08-26T18:59:00Z)\n  - Tim is busy with his studies. (event_time: 2023-10-17T13:50:00Z)\n  - John knows a bit of German. (event_time: 2024-01-02T17:26:00Z)\n  - In his free time, Tim enjoys hobbies like reading a good book. (event_time: 2023-10-21T17:51:00Z)\n  - Tim enjoys traveling. (event_time: 2024-01-02T17:26:00Z)\n  - John wants to know what Tim is keen to check out in Galway (event_time: 2024-01-07T17:24:00Z)\n  - Tim recently picked up new skills. (event_time: 2023-12-06T17:34:00Z)\n  - Tim is looking for new reads (event_time: 2023-12-08T19:42:00Z)\n  - John is asking Tim what genres of music Tim wants to learn. (event_time: 2023-12-06T17:34:00Z)\n  - Tim loves fantasy. (event_time: 2023-08-02T16:17:00Z)\n  - Tim has been occupied with reading lately. (event_time: 2023-11-11T15:36:00Z)\n  - John is asking Tim what Tim wrote on the whiteboard. (event_time: 2023-10-21T17:51:00Z)\n  - John is asking Tim what instrument Tim is playing. (event_time: 2023-12-06T17:34:00Z)\n  - Tim is asking John what kind of stuff John is exploring. (event_time: 2023-07-16T16:21:00Z)\n  - Tim finds that his passions bring him closer to people from all over the world. (event_time: 2023-10-13T13:50:00Z)\n  - John congratulates Tim on the opportunity to write about what Tim is into. (event_time: 2023-08-02T16:17:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - French: Tim mentions taking French in high school while discussing the difficulty of learning German.\n  - Tim: Tim joined a group of globetrotters. He finds learning German tough but worthwhile, contrasting it with French. Italy is on his travel list.\n  - language: John is learning a language, inspired by an awesome book from his Italy trip. Learning another language is tough but rewarding, according to Tim.\n  - app: Tim mentioned an app is great for learning another language, noting the difficulty and rewards.\n  - German lessons: Tim confirmed appreciation for encouragement and will keep up with German lessons.\n  - Tim: Tim visited an unbelievable castle in the UK last Friday. He is currently swamped with exams this week but is pushing through them.\n  - Tim: Tim joined a group of globetrotters, enjoys chatting with travel enthusiasts, likes Italy, and considers Harry Potter his favorite book.\n  - Tim: Tim writes articles about fantasy novels. He talked to John about his trip to Chicago, sports game connection, and the meaning of special basketball shoes.\n  - Tim: Tim previously asked John for storytelling advice after a setback with UK experiences; he is also learning the violin (classical, jazz, film scores) and joined a travel club.\n  - Tim: Tim mentioned that good support is essential and asked John about a fantasy novel by Patrick Rothfuss, suggesting it for travel.\n  - Tim: Tim is congratulated on success and mentioned as having an English lit class that he did his best in.\n  - Tim: Tim congratulated John on getting an endorsement with a popular beverage company and is studying abroad in Galway, Ireland next month; he is also considering visiting Barcelona.\n  - Tim: Tim joined a group of globetrotters interested in travel. Tim chatted with John, mentioned Italy is on his list, and likes fantasy books like LOTR for their immersive details.\n  - Tim: Tim talked to John about John's 40-point game. Tim is writing rewarding articles about fantasy novels for an online magazine.\n  - Tim: Tim congratulated John on getting an endorsement with a beverage company and asked about the visa requirements for upcoming travel.\n  - Tim: Tim joined a group of globetrotters, wants to visit Italy, and is interested in John's favorite characters from fantasy films, like Star Wars.\n  - Tim: Tim joined a group of globetrotters who share his interests. He is chatting with John, who recently returned from an awesome trip to Italy.\n  - Tim: Tim, an assistant, recently attended an incredible Harry Potter conference in the UK, which inspired him and allowed him to connect with others passionate about fantasy.\n  - Tim: Tim recently joined a travel club to learn about different cultures and is excited to meet new people. He also asked John about playing professionally.\n  - Tim: Tim greeted John, inquired about his new top-notch hiking and outdoor gear, and asked about the successful photoshoot in a gorgeous forest.\n  - Tim: Tim is reading an awesome book about UK castles and is writing a fantasy novel. He is excited