ersation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Art provides solace for Deborah. (event_time: 2023-04-09T16:30:00Z)\n  - Deborah finds the exercise calming. (event_time: 2023-03-13T11:22:00Z)\n  - Deborah found comfort in her work after the setback. (event_time: 2023-09-08T19:39:00Z)\n  - Artwork can bring back powerful emotions for Deborah. (event_time: 2023-04-09T16:30:00Z)\n  - The art show reminded Deborah of her mom. (event_time: 2023-04-09T16:30:00Z)\n  - Deborah feels like she is still experiencing art shows with her mom. (event_time: 2023-04-09T16:30:00Z)\n  - Nature helps Deborah forget the daily craziness and find inner peace. (event_time: 2023-02-04T09:48:00Z)\n  - A pet brings comfort to Deborah. (event_time: 2023-01-27T09:49:00Z)\n  - Deborah attends art shows. (event_time: 2023-04-09T16:30:00Z)\n  - Deborah has a pet that provides a calming feeling and comfort. (event_time: 2023-08-26T17:33:00Z)\n  - The studio is always calming for Deborah. (event_time: 2023-06-06T15:56:00Z)\n  - Deborah went to an art show with a friend today. (event_time: 2023-04-09T16:30:00Z)\n  - Artwork reminds Deborah of those she has lost. (event_time: 2023-04-09T16:30:00Z)\n  - Deborah attended an art show with a friend today. (event_time: 2023-04-09T16:30:00Z)\n  - Deborah feels calm when getting lost in nature. (event_time: 2023-02-04T09:48:00Z)\n  - Deborah stays grounded by going out for walks. (event_time: 2023-08-21T09:11:00Z)\n  - Nature is refreshing for Deborah (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:00Z)\n  - Deborah felt awe when admiring Nature's artwork (event_time: 2023-09-20T10:17:00Z)\n  - Debor