Joanna will not give up on her goals (event_time: 2022-10-06T11:15:00Z)\n  - Joanna intends to keep making great new memories. (event_time: 2022-11-07T20:10:00Z)\n  - Joanna cannot imagine life without writing (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna intends to keep believing in herself. (event_time: 2022-10-21T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna has a strong aptitude for writing. (event_time: 2022-11-07T20:10:00Z)\n  - Joanna believes that even the small things contribute to making life enjoyable and worthwhile. (event_time: 2022-04-17T18:44:00Z)\n  - Joanna believes going through many days of intense gaming would be difficult. (event_time: 2022-03-24T13:43:00Z)\n  - Joanna views writing as a huge part of who she is. (event_time: 2022-08-14T18:12:00Z)\n  - Writing might be a way for Joanna to express creativity. (event_time: 2022-08-14T18:12:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - support: Joanna sees support as a blessing that motivates her to keep pushing forward, relating it to Nate's encouragement despite his tournament stress.\n  - strength and perseverance: Joanna mentioned that 'strength and perseverance' make her think of those qualities and help motivate her in tough times.\n  - progress: Joanna is determined to keep grinding and moving ahead despite writing difficulties, after losing all her work progress when her laptop crashed. Nate expressed sympathy.\n  - writing inspiration: Joanna uses taking breaks and self-care for writing inspiration to maintain inspiration and mental health, seeking balance.\n  - writing: Joanna feels she cannot stop writing recently, appreciating Nate's support and encouragement.\n  - motivation: Joanna's cork board has inspiring quotes/pictures for motivation and creativity. She gains motivation from having someone to support her.\n  - stories: Joanna finds happiness and fulfillment in creating stories and watching them come alive, calling writing a blessing for her.\n 